  "description": "Upgrade your Wrangler with a rugged front bumper engineered for maximum protection, improved clearance, and aggressive styling. Built for both on-road and off-road performance, this bumper delivers the durability and coverage your Jeep needs while enhancing its bold appearance.\nFeatures\nSuperior Impact Protection: Designed to guard against dents, scrapes, and minor impacts during parking or tight maneuvers. The reinforced structure helps absorb impact and protects critical front-end components.\nPreserves Vehicle Value: Keeping your bumper protected helps maintain your vehicle’s condition and supports stronger resale value by preventing visible damage.\nImproved Ground Clearance: Factory bumpers on many trucks and SUVs sit low and can scrape curbs or obstacles. This upgraded bumper design provides additional clearance for better approach angles on trails or uneven terrain.\nHeavy-Duty Construction: Crafted from durable steel with precision laser welding and finished in a textured black powder coat for superior corrosion resistance and long-lasting performance in harsh environments.\nAggressive Off-Road Style: Enhances the rugged look of your Wrangler while maintaining full functionality—perfect for drivers who want their Jeep to stand out both on and off the trail.\n1-Year Warranty | Professional installation recommended for safety.\nFitment\nFits for 2018-2026 Jeep Wrangler JL all models. (Includes Unlimited, Rubicon, Sahara).\nNote: The shackle is not designed for towing and recovery, refer to the owner's manual for towing and rescue information. Overload is not included in after-sales service.",
